1
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:07,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:09,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[rain splattering]</b></font>

3
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:12,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ugh, this totally sucks.</b></font>

4
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:13,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

5
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:16,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We were having a blast
a couple of minutes ago!</b></font>

6
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:17,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-How funny!
-Seriously?</b></font>

7
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This isn't funny, so shut up!</b></font>

8
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:21,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't understand
how we got lost</b></font>

9
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if Ishimori
was looking at the map.</b></font>

10
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:25,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, were you not paying
attention or something?</b></font>

11
00:00:26,070 --> 00:00:27,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

12
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:28,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, it's pretty gross
to throw her</b></font>

13
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:30,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>under the bus for this,
you know?</b></font>

14
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[humming]
-Just sayin'.</b></font>

15
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:34,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's weird, 'cause we followed
all the signs, right?</b></font>

16
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:36,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NATSUMI]
Maybe someone messed with 'em.</b></font>

17
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:37,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[humming]
-[MIKARIN] Wait, you think so?</b></font>

18
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:39,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Listen, everyone.</b></font>

19
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's calm down
and think for a sec.</b></font>

20
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:43,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm scared!
I wanna go home!</b></font>

21
00:00:43,750 --> 00:00:45,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mama's gonna be
so worried about me!</b></font>

22
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:47,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Momo crying]
-Hm?</b></font>

23
00:00:48,510 --> 00:00:50,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIKARIN]
So, what do we do now?</b></font>

24
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[TONBO] Don't look at me.
-I'll go.</b></font>

25
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:55,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'll get us back on the trail!</b></font>

26
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:56,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasping]</b></font>

27
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait!
Where are you going?</b></font>

28
00:00:58,310 --> 00:00:59,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

29
00:00:59,810 --> 00:01:00,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Crap.</b></font>

30
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:02,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Kai?</b></font>

31
00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

32
00:02:35,030 --> 00:02:39,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>SPARKLE 4
HOWEVER DISTANT WE MAY BE</b></font>

33
00:02:40,290 --> 00:02:43,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Once again,
I'm basically just dead weight.</b></font>

34
00:02:44,330 --> 00:02:46,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanted to be helpful
to everyone.</b></font>

35
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:48,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But now we're all worse off.</b></font>

36
00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:49,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

37
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What are you doing?</b></font>

38
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:54,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't know.</b></font>

39
00:02:55,050 --> 00:02:57,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm trying to be
the person I want to be.</b></font>

40
00:02:58,640 --> 00:02:59,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Maybe I can't.</b></font>

41
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:02,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe I'm wrong
about all of it.</b></font>

42
00:03:03,060 --> 00:03:04,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I got us lost.</b></font>

43
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:06,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What if we can't get back?</b></font>

44
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:07,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

45
00:03:07,730 --> 00:03:09,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

46
00:03:09,570 --> 00:03:10,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's okay.</b></font>

47
00:03:11,070 --> 00:03:12,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just calm down.</b></font>

48
00:03:12,690 --> 00:03:14,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
We'll be just fine.</b></font>

49
00:03:15,530 --> 00:03:17,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunting]</b></font>

50
00:03:18,570 --> 00:03:19,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The hell?</b></font>

51
00:03:19,830 --> 00:03:21,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey!</b></font>

52
00:03:21,490 --> 00:03:22,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah?</b></font>

53
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:24,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

54
00:03:26,210 --> 00:03:27,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

55
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

56
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh!</b></font>

57
00:03:34,210 --> 00:03:35,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This bridge here.</b></font>

58
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:36,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's on the map.</b></font>

59
00:03:37,010 --> 00:03:38,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

60
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:41,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

61
00:03:41,310 --> 00:03:42,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[rain splattering]</b></font>

62
00:03:44,220 --> 00:03:45,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[gasps]
-Wait.</b></font>

63
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:47,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stay right here, okay?</b></font>

64
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[running footsteps]</b></font>

65
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:51,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

66
00:03:51,820 --> 00:03:53,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

67
00:03:55,940 --> 00:03:57,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

68
00:03:57,650 --> 00:03:59,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

69
00:04:03,410 --> 00:04:05,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[NAGANO] Ishimori.
-Huh?</b></font>

70
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:07,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, I'm so sorry.</b></font>

71
00:04:07,160 --> 00:04:09,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I shouldn't have
blamed you like that.</b></font>

72
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's fine.</b></font>

73
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:12,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sneezes]</b></font>

74
00:04:13,050 --> 00:04:15,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh-oh, Nagano,
did you already catch a cold?</b></font>

75
00:04:15,550 --> 00:04:16,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAGANO]
I'll be all right.</b></font>

76
00:04:18,180 --> 00:04:20,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, um...Nagano,</b></font>

77
00:04:20,430 --> 00:04:21,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you need a towel?</b></font>

78
00:04:21,890 --> 00:04:23,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, yeah, that'd be great.</b></font>

79
00:04:25,020 --> 00:04:26,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI]
Wait.</b></font>

80
00:04:26,100 --> 00:04:28,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, does that humongous
backpack of hers</b></font>

81
00:04:28,100 --> 00:04:29,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>have enough stuff
for all of us?</b></font>

82
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:31,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIKARIN] Is that why
she brought that giant one?</b></font>

83
00:04:32,020 --> 00:04:33,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI]
Yeah, I think so.</b></font>

84
00:04:33,820 --> 00:04:35,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's cool, you know?</b></font>

85
00:04:36,110 --> 00:04:37,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, yeah.</b></font>

86
00:04:37,190 --> 00:04:38,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-She's really stepping up.
-Should have more than enough.</b></font>

87
00:04:38,650 --> 00:04:40,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So feel free to go ahead
and drink as much as you need.</b></font>

88
00:04:40,860 --> 00:04:42,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footfall]</b></font>

89
00:04:43,370 --> 00:04:44,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

90
00:04:46,620 --> 00:04:48,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] Here.
-Huh?</b></font>

91
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:50,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I bet you're thirsty,
and you gave yours away.</b></font>

92
00:04:51,330 --> 00:04:53,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
I drank some, but here.</b></font>

93
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:56,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I really shouldn't take it if
you've already started on it.</b></font>

94
00:04:56,550 --> 00:04:58,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not really the time
to be picky.</b></font>

95
00:04:59,170 --> 00:05:00,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Just drink it, okay?</b></font>

96
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:02,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Actually, I'm being serious.</b></font>

97
00:05:02,970 --> 00:05:05,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I mean, I don't deserve it.</b></font>

98
00:05:05,220 --> 00:05:06,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

99
00:05:06,850 --> 00:05:08,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What am I even saying?</b></font>

100
00:05:10,020 --> 00:05:11,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miura's got me all mixed up.</b></font>

101
00:05:11,940 --> 00:05:14,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He keeps flipping
between being really nice</b></font>

102
00:05:14,270 --> 00:05:15,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and downright cold.</b></font>

103
00:05:15,940 --> 00:05:17,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

104
00:05:17,940 --> 00:05:19,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] You're too tired
to think straight, huh?</b></font>

105
00:05:19,990 --> 00:05:21,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

106
00:05:21,610 --> 00:05:22,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

107
00:05:22,870 --> 00:05:24,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

108
00:05:25,410 --> 00:05:27,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh!</b></font>

109
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
How's this happening?</b></font>

110
00:05:28,790 --> 00:05:31,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I never dreamt
I'd fall in love.</b></font>

111
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:33,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was always just looking
at the ground in front of me.</b></font>

112
00:05:34,670 --> 00:05:36,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO] Hey, wasn't
there supposed to be</b></font>

113
00:05:36,340 --> 00:05:38,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>some kinda "heart
in the sky" thing to look at?</b></font>

114
00:05:38,460 --> 00:05:40,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI]
Now's not the time, dude!</b></font>

115
00:05:40,340 --> 00:05:42,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Guys, come here and look up.</b></font>

116
00:05:42,470 --> 00:05:43,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ishimori found something cool.</b></font>

117
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:45,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MARIN] Oh, yeah?
-[MIKARIN] Whoa!</b></font>

118
00:05:45,100 --> 00:05:46,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I wanna see!
-It does look like a heart!</b></font>

119
00:05:46,890 --> 00:05:47,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAGANO]
Is it good luck?</b></font>

120
00:05:47,970 --> 00:05:49,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIKARIN] If you look
at it with your crush,</b></font>

121
00:05:49,470 --> 00:05:50,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>your wish'll come true!</b></font>

122
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:52,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[ASUMI] Oh, I see it!
-[TONBO] Go on and make a wish!</b></font>

123
00:05:52,850 --> 00:05:53,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI]
I don't know what I want!</b></font>

124
00:05:53,980 --> 00:05:55,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
It's amazing.</b></font>

125
00:05:55,610 --> 00:05:58,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Even if it's raining,
I'll still look up.</b></font>

126
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:01,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And wish that
we all get home safely.</b></font>

127
00:06:02,820 --> 00:06:04,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

128
00:06:05,530 --> 00:06:07,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

129
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Blue sky.</b></font>

130
00:06:11,910 --> 00:06:13,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The rainbow after the storms.</b></font>

131
00:06:14,710 --> 00:06:17,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And the warm, golden sunlight
breaking through the clouds.</b></font>

132
00:06:18,670 --> 00:06:19,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's where I am now.</b></font>

133
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:21,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]
So loud.</b></font>

134
00:06:22,590 --> 00:06:24,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Tryin' to catch some Zs, here.</b></font>

135
00:06:25,390 --> 00:06:27,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
It's all so wonderful.</b></font>

136
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:29,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I may get the wrong idea again.</b></font>

137
00:06:29,850 --> 00:06:31,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-[whimpering]</b></font>

138
00:06:32,810 --> 00:06:34,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

139
00:06:34,390 --> 00:06:36,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

140
00:06:37,270 --> 00:06:39,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-You're my pillow.
-[gasps]</b></font>

141
00:06:39,190 --> 00:06:41,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Um, is this really okay?</b></font>

142
00:06:41,740 --> 00:06:43,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Stop talking.
-Okay.</b></font>

143
00:06:44,070 --> 00:06:45,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kai sighs]</b></font>

144
00:06:46,620 --> 00:06:48,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
"Nothing comes from it.</b></font>

145
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Only heartbreak."</b></font>

146
00:06:50,330 --> 00:06:53,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I haven't found out exactly
what she meant by that yet,</b></font>

147
00:06:53,710 --> 00:06:55,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I'm bound
to learn eventually.</b></font>

148
00:06:55,540 --> 00:06:57,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

149
00:06:57,130 --> 00:07:00,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was able to accept
those feelings before.</b></font>

150
00:07:00,210 --> 00:07:01,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But Miura gave me hope.</b></font>

151
00:07:02,590 --> 00:07:04,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need to just enjoy it
while I can.</b></font>

152
00:07:04,630 --> 00:07:06,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[engine whirring]</b></font>

153
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Thanks, Dad!</b></font>

154
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:12,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your backpack
really came in handy!</b></font>

155
00:07:12,350 --> 00:07:13,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's great.</b></font>

156
00:07:13,430 --> 00:07:15,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, did you have fun
on your field trip?</b></font>

157
00:07:15,690 --> 00:07:16,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, yeah!</b></font>

158
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:19,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

159
00:07:19,610 --> 00:07:21,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What a change.</b></font>

160
00:07:21,230 --> 00:07:23,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can be positive
without lying.</b></font>

161
00:07:23,820 --> 00:07:26,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And now,
I can't wait to get to school.</b></font>

162
00:07:26,150 --> 00:07:27,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

163
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good morning.</b></font>

164
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:29,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

165
00:07:30,740 --> 00:07:32,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Wait...</b></font>

166
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:34,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>what's all that stuff
on my desk?</b></font>

167
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:36,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is...someone messing with me?</b></font>

168
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:38,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, she's here!</b></font>

169
00:07:38,500 --> 00:07:39,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mornin', Ishimori!</b></font>

170
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:42,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO] Sorry, guess we kinda
covered your whole desk.</b></font>

171
00:07:42,590 --> 00:07:45,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But it's not like we talked
to each other about it first.</b></font>

172
00:07:46,010 --> 00:07:48,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIKARIN] Yeah, we just
all ended up bringing stuff.</b></font>

173
00:07:49,260 --> 00:07:50,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI] They're meant
to be some little</b></font>

174
00:07:50,430 --> 00:07:52,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>thank you gifts for yesterday.</b></font>

175
00:07:52,350 --> 00:07:53,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If that's cool.</b></font>

176
00:07:53,850 --> 00:07:55,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO] We might've gone
a little overboard.</b></font>

177
00:07:55,980 --> 00:07:56,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI]
Darn it.</b></font>

178
00:07:57,060 --> 00:07:58,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, sorry about that.</b></font>

179
00:07:58,940 --> 00:08:01,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a little extra, huh?</b></font>

180
00:08:01,230 --> 00:08:03,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's perfect, thank you all.</b></font>

181
00:08:03,610 --> 00:08:04,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I love it!</b></font>

182
00:08:04,820 --> 00:08:06,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

183
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

184
00:08:08,660 --> 00:08:10,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Wow.</b></font>

185
00:08:10,620 --> 00:08:12,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm actually really happy.</b></font>

186
00:08:15,450 --> 00:08:16,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm?</b></font>

187
00:08:16,750 --> 00:08:19,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, look who decided
to join us.</b></font>

188
00:08:19,370 --> 00:08:20,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, yeah.</b></font>

189
00:08:20,830 --> 00:08:22,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]
Didn't get ya anything.</b></font>

190
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Didn't borrow a towel anyway.</b></font>

191
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:26,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fine with me.</b></font>

192
00:08:26,130 --> 00:08:27,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

193
00:08:27,550 --> 00:08:29,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Am I allowed to be this lucky?</b></font>

194
00:08:30,050 --> 00:08:32,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When do I get hit
by a bolt of lightning?</b></font>

195
00:08:32,510 --> 00:08:34,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Hey, Ishimori!
-[UKA] What's up?</b></font>

196
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:36,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ASUMI] I took a pic
of that "sky heart"</b></font>

197
00:08:37,060 --> 00:08:38,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you found yesterday,</b></font>

198
00:08:38,140 --> 00:08:39,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and it's gotten over
three hundred likes!</b></font>

199
00:08:39,940 --> 00:08:41,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU] [gasps]
That's so cool!</b></font>

200
00:08:41,560 --> 00:08:43,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ASUMI] Yeah!
Maybe just a little scary.</b></font>

201
00:08:43,770 --> 00:08:45,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Three hundred people liked it?</b></font>

202
00:08:45,690 --> 00:08:47,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, you're gonna love this!</b></font>

203
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:48,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ASUMI]
Huh? Who's that?</b></font>

204
00:08:48,490 --> 00:08:49,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKINO]
You know that guy?</b></font>

205
00:08:49,610 --> 00:08:51,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Dang, he's a hottie!</b></font>

206
00:08:51,110 --> 00:08:52,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who is that, anyway?</b></font>

207
00:08:52,660 --> 00:08:54,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seriously?
This is Kai, guys.</b></font>

208
00:08:54,790 --> 00:08:56,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasping]</b></font>

209
00:08:57,290 --> 00:08:58,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, not joking.</b></font>

210
00:08:58,370 --> 00:09:00,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ASUMI] Miura, you've gotta
rock the black hair again!</b></font>

211
00:09:00,670 --> 00:09:02,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Is that from your yearbook?
-[YURU] Yep.</b></font>

212
00:09:02,330 --> 00:09:04,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Bring the book with you!
-[YURU] Uh-uh.</b></font>

213
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:06,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[ASUMI] Why not?
-I wanna see it, too!</b></font>

214
00:09:06,670 --> 00:09:07,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU]
Hmm, well...</b></font>

215
00:09:07,670 --> 00:09:09,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll show you mine
if you show me yours.</b></font>

216
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:11,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] [gasps]
My old yearbook.</b></font>

217
00:09:12,470 --> 00:09:14,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You, too, Ishimori!</b></font>

218
00:09:14,180 --> 00:09:16,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We'd love to see your
yearbook from junior high!</b></font>

219
00:09:16,850 --> 00:09:18,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Huh?</b></font>

220
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:21,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI'S MALE FRIEND 1B]
"Stony?"</b></font>

221
00:09:21,690 --> 00:09:24,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's the nickname everyone
called her in junior high.</b></font>

222
00:09:24,230 --> 00:09:25,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI] And all she does
is stare at people</b></font>

223
00:09:25,610 --> 00:09:26,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with a blank face.</b></font>

224
00:09:26,980 --> 00:09:29,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's no better name!
Not for a freak like that!</b></font>

225
00:09:31,950 --> 00:09:35,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[ASUMI] Oh, sorry if, uh--
-[YURU] Like, "Sorry" for what?</b></font>

226
00:09:35,530 --> 00:09:38,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ASUMI] No, I mean, no pressure
if you'd rather not.</b></font>

227
00:09:41,250 --> 00:09:43,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] [chuckles]
Yeah.</b></font>

228
00:09:43,130 --> 00:09:44,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, thank you.</b></font>

229
00:09:44,790 --> 00:09:45,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just spaced a little.</b></font>

230
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:47,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GROUP]
Hmm?</b></font>

231
00:09:47,170 --> 00:09:48,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

232
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:02,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groaning]</b></font>

233
00:10:02,390 --> 00:10:03,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Let's see.</b></font>

234
00:10:06,650 --> 00:10:07,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[thuds]</b></font>

235
00:10:07,730 --> 00:10:08,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

236
00:10:11,110 --> 00:10:12,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Huh?</b></font>

237
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There it is.</b></font>

238
00:10:14,660 --> 00:10:16,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorta happy
I could still find it,</b></font>

239
00:10:16,950 --> 00:10:18,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and sorta not.</b></font>

240
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:19,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

241
00:10:19,540 --> 00:10:21,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've never opened it.</b></font>

242
00:10:21,330 --> 00:10:23,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was too scared
of what I might find inside.</b></font>

243
00:10:24,630 --> 00:10:26,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

244
00:10:26,590 --> 00:10:28,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

245
00:10:32,010 --> 00:10:34,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good. It's safe.</b></font>

246
00:10:34,300 --> 00:10:35,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm normal.</b></font>

247
00:10:36,390 --> 00:10:38,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was worried
my face would look weird,</b></font>

248
00:10:38,100 --> 00:10:39,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or maybe I blinked,
or something.</b></font>

249
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:43,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But it's okay.
I can show them.</b></font>

250
00:10:43,690 --> 00:10:45,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's nothing too bad.</b></font>

251
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:48,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU]
I've got the goods!</b></font>

252
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm so ugly here!</b></font>

253
00:10:49,650 --> 00:10:51,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You kidding?
You look great!</b></font>

254
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:53,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ooh, this girl's from Class C!</b></font>

255
00:10:53,110 --> 00:10:54,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Oh.
-[ASUMI] Yeah!</b></font>

256
00:10:54,820 --> 00:10:57,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[ASUMI] Ah, this guy's cute!
-[YUKINO] Taken, I'm afraid.</b></font>

257
00:10:57,410 --> 00:10:58,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ASUMI]
Ugh!</b></font>

258
00:10:58,490 --> 00:11:00,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And here we have
West Junior High!</b></font>

259
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:02,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ooh! Let me see!</b></font>

260
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:04,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKINO]
Wow, is that Takamine?</b></font>

261
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:06,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[ASUMI] Seto's here, too!
-[YUKINO] And that's Ayumi!</b></font>

262
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:09,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] [whimpering]
She looks adorable!</b></font>

263
00:11:09,170 --> 00:11:10,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You were all in the same class?</b></font>

264
00:11:10,590 --> 00:11:12,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU]
Whoa, we got a hottie alert!</b></font>

265
00:11:12,670 --> 00:11:13,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU]
Uh, who?</b></font>

266
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:15,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU]
That one. Serina Kanno!</b></font>

267
00:11:15,260 --> 00:11:16,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ASUMI]
Holy crap, she's gorgeous!</b></font>

268
00:11:17,050 --> 00:11:18,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[ASUMI] Is she famous?
-[YURU] She is to us!</b></font>

269
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:20,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
She's so pretty.</b></font>

270
00:11:20,310 --> 00:11:21,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And Miura shared
a class with her.</b></font>

271
00:11:21,810 --> 00:11:23,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU]
The boys were obsessed!</b></font>

272
00:11:23,100 --> 00:11:24,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And she's a total sweetheart!</b></font>

273
00:11:24,180 --> 00:11:25,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU] Meanwhile, Kai's
looking stiff as a board.</b></font>

274
00:11:26,020 --> 00:11:27,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU]
Least he's consistent, though.</b></font>

275
00:11:27,350 --> 00:11:29,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Boy does not smile.</b></font>

276
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:31,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ASUMI] Oh, I've got a few
from the field trip!</b></font>

277
00:11:31,860 --> 00:11:33,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, I have one
from Field Day.</b></font>

278
00:11:33,530 --> 00:11:34,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU]
Was this a party?</b></font>

279
00:11:34,650 --> 00:11:37,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Yesterday, they all
avoided mentioning my past.</b></font>

280
00:11:38,780 --> 00:11:41,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I shouldn't force it on them.
That's stupid.</b></font>

281
00:11:42,370 --> 00:11:44,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Honestly, it was silly.</b></font>

282
00:11:45,580 --> 00:11:47,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why would I think it would help
me be a part of the group?</b></font>

283
00:11:47,330 --> 00:11:49,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hold on, she's leaving?</b></font>

284
00:11:49,420 --> 00:11:50,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'm so embarrassed.</b></font>

285
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

286
00:11:53,550 --> 00:11:54,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

287
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:02,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
It's just too much for me.</b></font>

288
00:12:02,470 --> 00:12:04,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't let other people
see my past.</b></font>

289
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:06,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll lock it up back home.</b></font>

290
00:12:07,810 --> 00:12:08,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course...</b></font>

291
00:12:09,560 --> 00:12:11,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wish I could lock up
the memories with it.</b></font>

292
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:14,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]
You're here?</b></font>

293
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:17,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-So, where are you?
-Hold on!</b></font>

294
00:12:17,240 --> 00:12:18,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, g-give that
give that back to me!</b></font>

295
00:12:18,700 --> 00:12:20,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Just answer.
-Um?</b></font>

296
00:12:21,950 --> 00:12:23,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was Class Four.</b></font>

297
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:27,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-You look good here.
-Huh!</b></font>

298
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
I figured since you ran away,</b></font>

299
00:12:28,210 --> 00:12:29,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it must've been a bad photo.</b></font>

300
00:12:30,710 --> 00:12:31,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nothing like that.</b></font>

301
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:34,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't have any
good memories.</b></font>

302
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:37,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And there were no fun stories
I could share with them.</b></font>

303
00:12:37,340 --> 00:12:39,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-So what?
-Huh?</b></font>

304
00:12:39,510 --> 00:12:41,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What?
You heard me.</b></font>

305
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:43,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-So, I want to forget it.
-[KAI] Why?</b></font>

306
00:12:43,970 --> 00:12:45,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah?</b></font>

307
00:12:45,100 --> 00:12:47,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because it hurts?</b></font>

308
00:12:47,140 --> 00:12:49,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's why you can't forget.</b></font>

309
00:12:49,350 --> 00:12:51,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That pain turned you
into the person you are.</b></font>

310
00:12:51,730 --> 00:12:53,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And the person you are
is more than enough.</b></font>

311
00:12:53,940 --> 00:12:55,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Our whole class found
that out yesterday.</b></font>

312
00:12:56,070 --> 00:12:57,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

313
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

314
00:12:59,490 --> 00:13:01,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[wind rustling]</b></font>

315
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:08,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you mind
if I show them this one?</b></font>

316
00:13:08,210 --> 00:13:09,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's kinda funny.</b></font>

317
00:13:09,460 --> 00:13:10,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Huh!</b></font>

318
00:13:10,750 --> 00:13:12,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

319
00:13:12,290 --> 00:13:13,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let me do it!</b></font>

320
00:13:13,500 --> 00:13:15,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

321
00:13:17,630 --> 00:13:19,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

322
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Add it to the pile.</b></font>

323
00:13:24,810 --> 00:13:26,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I didn't lend you
anything yesterday.</b></font>

324
00:13:26,810 --> 00:13:28,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

325
00:13:28,520 --> 00:13:30,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
You still deserve it.</b></font>

326
00:13:30,140 --> 00:13:31,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles softly]</b></font>

327
00:13:31,560 --> 00:13:32,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

328
00:13:32,940 --> 00:13:34,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He's got a point.</b></font>

329
00:13:34,610 --> 00:13:36,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll be fine.</b></font>

330
00:13:36,610 --> 00:13:38,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll make new memories here.</b></font>

331
00:13:39,110 --> 00:13:40,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>With them!</b></font>

332
00:13:40,570 --> 00:13:41,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It'll be easy!</b></font>

333
00:13:45,490 --> 00:13:47,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

334
00:13:54,630 --> 00:13:57,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[TOMOYA] Hey, Uka?
-Huh?</b></font>

335
00:13:57,090 --> 00:13:58,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Have a second to chat?</b></font>

336
00:13:58,670 --> 00:14:00,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Sure.
-[TOMOYA] Go on.</b></font>

337
00:14:01,050 --> 00:14:03,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uhh...I'm sorry about before.</b></font>

338
00:14:04,930 --> 00:14:07,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know the messed up
sign on our hike?</b></font>

339
00:14:07,100 --> 00:14:08,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[TOMOYA] That was her.
-Huh!</b></font>

340
00:14:08,890 --> 00:14:10,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You really did that?
But why?</b></font>

341
00:14:11,850 --> 00:14:13,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've just gotten
so close to Kai.</b></font>

342
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:15,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's possible
I overreacted a bit</b></font>

343
00:14:15,690 --> 00:14:18,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and let my jealousy
get the best of me.</b></font>

344
00:14:18,280 --> 00:14:21,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But it's outta my system
and I won't do it again.</b></font>

345
00:14:21,110 --> 00:14:22,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Bye.
-Ah!</b></font>

346
00:14:25,030 --> 00:14:26,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]
Sorry.</b></font>

347
00:14:26,910 --> 00:14:28,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, it's fine.</b></font>

348
00:14:28,740 --> 00:14:30,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't know
where she got the idea</b></font>

349
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:31,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that I'm close with him.</b></font>

350
00:14:32,500 --> 00:14:33,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

351
00:14:33,620 --> 00:14:35,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Have you legitimately
not caught on yet?</b></font>

352
00:14:35,420 --> 00:14:36,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

353
00:14:36,500 --> 00:14:38,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You remember
what I told you before?</b></font>

354
00:14:38,460 --> 00:14:40,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How Kai can be
awkward sometimes,</b></font>

355
00:14:40,170 --> 00:14:42,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>since he barely
ever talks to girls?</b></font>

356
00:14:42,220 --> 00:14:44,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Neither of you realize
how close you are.</b></font>

357
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:47,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At least, how close
you look to everyone else.</b></font>

358
00:14:47,350 --> 00:14:48,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA]
It's fine.</b></font>

359
00:14:48,430 --> 00:14:49,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just something you should know,</b></font>

360
00:14:50,020 --> 00:14:51,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>'cause I'm sure
other girls think the same.</b></font>

361
00:14:52,060 --> 00:14:53,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You say he changed you, right?</b></font>

362
00:14:54,060 --> 00:14:56,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But how do you really know your
life is better with him in it?</b></font>

363
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:58,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I mean...</b></font>

364
00:14:58,860 --> 00:15:00,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA]
I'm not sure.</b></font>

365
00:15:00,400 --> 00:15:02,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You might've been
happier without him.</b></font>

366
00:15:03,570 --> 00:15:04,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's great he managed
to pull you</b></font>

367
00:15:04,950 --> 00:15:06,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>out of the pit you were in.</b></font>

368
00:15:06,780 --> 00:15:08,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But on the other hand,</b></font>

369
00:15:08,490 --> 00:15:10,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you've gotten into trouble
just because you're near him.</b></font>

370
00:15:11,040 --> 00:15:13,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Almost like a target's been
placed on your back.</b></font>

371
00:15:14,750 --> 00:15:15,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

372
00:15:15,830 --> 00:15:17,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let me ask you this.</b></font>

373
00:15:17,250 --> 00:15:19,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you truly making
any progress here?</b></font>

374
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:21,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA]
Or is it possible,</b></font>

375
00:15:21,260 --> 00:15:23,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you're still the same person
you've always been?</b></font>

376
00:15:24,510 --> 00:15:26,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you want to live
a happier life than before...</b></font>

377
00:15:27,680 --> 00:15:29,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>should you be next to Kai?</b></font>

378
00:15:31,100 --> 00:15:33,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
How am I supposed to take that?</b></font>

379
00:15:33,350 --> 00:15:35,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because to me, it sounds like</b></font>

380
00:15:35,520 --> 00:15:37,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he's saying I shouldn't
even be here.</b></font>

381
00:15:37,520 --> 00:15:39,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That I don't belong at all.</b></font>

382
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:45,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do I...Miura?</b></font>

383
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:46,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI]
Yo, Kai.</b></font>

384
00:15:46,490 --> 00:15:48,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is it true that you
and Serina Kanno</b></font>

385
00:15:48,410 --> 00:15:49,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>went out in junior high?</b></font>

386
00:15:49,870 --> 00:15:51,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KUMIKO] She's your ex?
-Who's she?</b></font>

387
00:15:51,490 --> 00:15:52,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is that for real?</b></font>

388
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:54,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just shut up already.</b></font>

389
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:56,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YASUSHI] That's not a no!
-[gasps]</b></font>

390
00:15:56,460 --> 00:15:57,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UNDERCUT] Crazy.
-[YASUSHI] That’s wild.</b></font>

391
00:15:57,670 --> 00:15:58,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

392
00:15:59,920 --> 00:16:02,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I thought
maybe if I chased him,</b></font>

393
00:16:02,090 --> 00:16:04,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I could slowly get closer.</b></font>

394
00:16:04,590 --> 00:16:05,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
But there’s no chance.</b></font>

395
00:16:06,050 --> 00:16:07,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

396
00:16:07,470 --> 00:16:09,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I just happen to be near him,</b></font>

397
00:16:09,930 --> 00:16:11,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I'm still all alone.</b></font>

398
00:16:12,930 --> 00:16:15,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[coughs] I'm trying
so hard to catch up,</b></font>

399
00:16:15,430 --> 00:16:17,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but the distance
is only growing.</b></font>

400
00:16:21,230 --> 00:16:22,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[beeping]</b></font>

401
00:16:22,690 --> 00:16:24,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA'S MOM]
Let's take a look.</b></font>

402
00:16:24,360 --> 00:16:27,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good! It's come down
a lot since yesterday!</b></font>

403
00:16:28,070 --> 00:16:30,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't overwork yourself
when you're back at school.</b></font>

404
00:16:31,030 --> 00:16:32,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll go get some fruit for you.</b></font>

405
00:16:33,040 --> 00:16:34,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

406
00:16:34,490 --> 00:16:36,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I wound up
coming down with a cold.</b></font>

407
00:16:36,910 --> 00:16:39,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have to get better fast.</b></font>

408
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:40,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The longer I'm out of school,</b></font>

409
00:16:40,330 --> 00:16:42,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the more I'll make people
worry about me.</b></font>

410
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

411
00:16:44,590 --> 00:16:45,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

412
00:16:46,380 --> 00:16:48,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[door opens]
-[UKA'S MOM] Uka, guess what?</b></font>

413
00:16:49,050 --> 00:16:51,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your friend's calling!
A nice girl named "Ayumi!"</b></font>

414
00:16:51,800 --> 00:16:53,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

415
00:16:54,390 --> 00:16:55,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Here you go!
-Thank you.</b></font>

416
00:16:56,020 --> 00:16:58,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hi, uh, Ayumi.
Are you there?</b></font>

417
00:16:59,390 --> 00:17:00,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
No, it's me.</b></font>

418
00:17:01,270 --> 00:17:02,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Smooth move, dude.</b></font>

419
00:17:02,560 --> 00:17:04,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kai, don't take
my phone like that!</b></font>

420
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:06,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-How ya holdin' up?
-[whimpering]</b></font>

421
00:17:06,440 --> 00:17:07,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
You there?</b></font>

422
00:17:07,990 --> 00:17:09,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[rumbling]</b></font>

423
00:17:10,110 --> 00:17:11,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] What?
No, no, no, no, no, no, no!</b></font>

424
00:17:11,910 --> 00:17:14,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wasn't ready!
That was his voice.</b></font>

425
00:17:14,120 --> 00:17:15,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

426
00:17:17,370 --> 00:17:20,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry.
Am I talking to Miura?</b></font>

427
00:17:20,460 --> 00:17:22,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
You got it.</b></font>

428
00:17:22,330 --> 00:17:23,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ayumi's here.</b></font>

429
00:17:23,540 --> 00:17:25,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She wanted to know
what you're up to today.</b></font>

430
00:17:25,840 --> 00:17:27,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Think she was hoping
to hang out.</b></font>

431
00:17:27,670 --> 00:17:29,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[coughs]
-That sounds like a no.</b></font>

432
00:17:29,760 --> 00:17:31,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Can't, if ya got a cold.</b></font>

433
00:17:31,390 --> 00:17:33,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
No, I'm not that bad.</b></font>

434
00:17:33,100 --> 00:17:34,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[coughs]</b></font>

435
00:17:34,930 --> 00:17:36,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
So, you coming, then?</b></font>

436
00:17:36,470 --> 00:17:37,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] What?
That's awful.</b></font>

437
00:17:37,930 --> 00:17:39,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't know you were sick!</b></font>

438
00:17:39,430 --> 00:17:40,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Well...I'd rather</b></font>

439
00:17:40,810 --> 00:17:43,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you stayed home
if you're sick.</b></font>

440
00:17:43,190 --> 00:17:44,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry, I can't go.</b></font>

441
00:17:44,650 --> 00:17:46,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's okay!
Just get well quickly!</b></font>

442
00:17:47,030 --> 00:17:48,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

443
00:17:48,490 --> 00:17:49,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thanks!</b></font>

444
00:17:49,740 --> 00:17:51,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-See ya.
-[AYUMI] Need anything?</b></font>

445
00:17:51,660 --> 00:17:53,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Uh, no!</b></font>

446
00:17:53,320 --> 00:17:55,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I am really happy
to hear from you all</b></font>

447
00:17:55,280 --> 00:17:56,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>while I'm out sick!</b></font>

448
00:17:56,580 --> 00:17:58,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please tell Ayumi
I said so, too!</b></font>

449
00:17:59,290 --> 00:18:01,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA]
Hm.</b></font>

450
00:18:01,250 --> 00:18:04,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Oh, I meant to ask.
Which way to the train station?</b></font>

451
00:18:04,290 --> 00:18:06,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-[KAI] From your place.</b></font>

452
00:18:06,300 --> 00:18:08,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, uh...right.</b></font>

453
00:18:08,090 --> 00:18:09,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

454
00:18:10,050 --> 00:18:11,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
"My place?"</b></font>

455
00:18:11,430 --> 00:18:13,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait a second.</b></font>

456
00:18:13,220 --> 00:18:14,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

457
00:18:18,270 --> 00:18:20,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There she is! Uka!</b></font>

458
00:18:20,350 --> 00:18:21,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You okay?</b></font>

459
00:18:21,810 --> 00:18:23,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Sorry to show up uninvited!</b></font>

460
00:18:23,440 --> 00:18:25,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good to see ya, though!
Lookin' good!</b></font>

461
00:18:25,900 --> 00:18:26,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

462
00:18:26,980 --> 00:18:28,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, want us
to get you anything?</b></font>

463
00:18:28,150 --> 00:18:30,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] I'll see you,
tomorrow, yeah?</b></font>

464
00:18:30,150 --> 00:18:31,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

465
00:18:33,820 --> 00:18:35,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

466
00:18:35,240 --> 00:18:37,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's do something fun
when you're better!</b></font>

467
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:39,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Okay.</b></font>

468
00:18:39,830 --> 00:18:41,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sure.</b></font>

469
00:18:42,250 --> 00:18:43,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah!</b></font>

470
00:18:43,460 --> 00:18:45,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

471
00:18:46,210 --> 00:18:47,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[birds chirping]</b></font>

472
00:18:48,340 --> 00:18:51,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Listen up, I've got some photos
from the field trip here!</b></font>

473
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:53,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[ASUMI] For real?
-[YURU] Let us see!</b></font>

474
00:18:53,430 --> 00:18:55,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE] I'm making copies,
so write your names</b></font>

475
00:18:55,510 --> 00:18:56,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>on the ones you want.</b></font>

476
00:18:56,850 --> 00:18:58,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

477
00:18:59,850 --> 00:19:00,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI]
Check it.</b></font>

478
00:19:00,930 --> 00:19:03,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess Ishimori's
not big on posing?</b></font>

479
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:05,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like she's haunting
the mountain!</b></font>

480
00:19:05,270 --> 00:19:08,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course, Kai's expressionless
in every one.</b></font>

481
00:19:08,360 --> 00:19:09,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIYOSHI]
Are you surprised?</b></font>

482
00:19:09,530 --> 00:19:12,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI] Hold up.
He's smiling in some over here!</b></font>

483
00:19:12,190 --> 00:19:13,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIYOSHI]
Whoa, he is!</b></font>

484
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:15,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, Ishimori's next
to him in all of 'em!</b></font>

485
00:19:16,780 --> 00:19:17,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO]
Holy crap!</b></font>

486
00:19:17,990 --> 00:19:18,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[TONBO] You go, Ishimori!
-It's true!</b></font>

487
00:19:19,080 --> 00:19:20,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've seen how Kai
smiles when you're there.</b></font>

488
00:19:21,080 --> 00:19:22,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-Haven't you?</b></font>

489
00:19:23,330 --> 00:19:24,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?
[whimpering]</b></font>

490
00:19:25,830 --> 00:19:27,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You really didn't notice?</b></font>

491
00:19:27,420 --> 00:19:28,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah!</b></font>

492
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:30,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait...I get it now!</b></font>

493
00:19:30,840 --> 00:19:32,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Oh! Oh, my gosh!</b></font>

494
00:19:32,630 --> 00:19:34,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've got a crush on him!</b></font>

495
00:19:39,390 --> 00:19:41,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, you've got
a wingwoman here!</b></font>

496
00:19:41,810 --> 00:19:44,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though you're not making it
very easy on yourself, are you?</b></font>

497
00:19:45,770 --> 00:19:48,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]
I'm aware.</b></font>

498
00:19:48,310 --> 00:19:51,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I've got a friend
I can talk with about anything,</b></font>

499
00:19:51,280 --> 00:19:52,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and a boy I like.</b></font>

500
00:19:52,940 --> 00:19:55,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] [chuckles]
Check it out!</b></font>

501
00:19:55,990 --> 00:19:58,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We've got the rare "Kai smile."</b></font>

502
00:19:58,780 --> 00:19:59,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

503
00:19:59,910 --> 00:20:00,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm?</b></font>

504
00:20:01,030 --> 00:20:04,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] And Ishimori's got
a lot of good ones, too!</b></font>

505
00:20:04,290 --> 00:20:05,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're fine.</b></font>

506
00:20:05,370 --> 00:20:07,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Her smile's
got something to it.</b></font>

507
00:20:07,670 --> 00:20:09,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
How so?</b></font>

508
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:11,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's honestly kinda cute.</b></font>

509
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:15,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps] There's something
I thought I'd never see!</b></font>

510
00:20:15,170 --> 00:20:17,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

511
00:20:19,640 --> 00:20:23,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] No matter
what anyone says, I'm staying.</b></font>

512
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:24,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm supposed to be here.</b></font>

513
00:20:25,730 --> 00:20:27,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even if I can't
close the distance</b></font>

514
00:20:27,850 --> 00:20:29,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and nothing changes,</b></font>

515
00:20:29,810 --> 00:20:32,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>here, the world is bright!</b></font>

516
00:22:04,830 --> 00:22:06,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[water trickling]</b></font>

517
00:22:08,250 --> 00:22:09,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[creaking]</b></font>

518
00:22:09,910 --> 00:22:11,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay, shake it off.</b></font>

519
00:22:13,830 --> 00:22:15,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footfall]</b></font>

520
00:22:16,800 --> 00:22:18,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Serina screaming]
-What the...</b></font>

521
00:22:21,800 --> 00:22:23,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

522
00:22:23,970 --> 00:22:25,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

523
00:22:28,560 --> 00:22:31,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA] Ah, I'm so sorry!
Did it hit you?</b></font>

524
00:22:31,770 --> 00:22:33,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, uh, no!</b></font>

525
00:22:33,730 --> 00:22:35,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
Oh, thank goodness!</b></font>

526
00:22:35,190 --> 00:22:36,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I so appreciate
you catching it!</b></font>

527
00:22:36,980 --> 00:22:37,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

528
00:22:38,070 --> 00:22:40,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Whatever happens
with all of this,</b></font>

529
00:22:40,150 --> 00:22:41,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll accept it.</b></font>

530
00:22:41,240 --> 00:22:42,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's taking so long, Serina?</b></font>

531
00:22:44,110 --> 00:22:45,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thanks again!</b></font>

532
00:22:46,330 --> 00:22:47,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
No matter what.</b></font>

533
00:22:50,040 --> 00:22:54,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TO BE CONTINUED</b></font>

